	"files": [
		{
			"content": "# Card 设计规范\n\n- 结构用 `Card.Header`（`Card.Title`、`Card.Description`、右上角操作 `Card.Action`）、`Card.Content`、`Card.Footer`，不要自己写标题样式和分隔线。\n- `Card.Title` 渲染为 `div`，不是标题元素：需要进入页面标题层级时，在里面放合适级别的标题元素（如 `<Card.Title><h2>…</h2></Card.Title>`），或传 `role=\"heading\"` 和 `aria-level`。\n- 紧凑卡片用 `size=\"sm\"`；内边距、间距和圆角跟随组件样式，不要用 `class` 改 `p-*`、`gap-*`、`rounded-*`。\n- 卡片内最多一个主按钮（见 Button 规范）；整张卡片可点击时，用卡片内的主链接或按钮承载点击，不要给 Card 加 `onclick`。\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "card/RULES.md"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>> = $props();\n</script>\n\n<div\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"card-action\"\n\tclass={cn(\n\t\t\"col-start-2 row-span-2 row-start-1 self-start justify-self-end\",\n\t\tclassName\n\t)}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{@render children?.()}\n</div>\n",
			"type": "registry:file",
			"target": "card/card-action.svelte"
		},
		{
			"content": "<script lang=\"ts\">\n\timport { cn, type WithElementRef } from \"$UTILS$.js\";\n\timport type { HTMLAttributes } from \"svelte/elements\";\n\n\tlet {\n\t\tref = $bindable(null),\n\t\tclass: className,\n\t\tchildren,\n\t\t...restProps\n\t}: WithElementRef<HTMLAttributes<HTMLDivElement>> = $props();\n</script>\n\n<div\n\tbind:this={ref}\n\tdata-slot=\"card-content\"\n\tclass={cn(\"px-(--card-spacing)\", className)}\n\t{...restProps}\n>\n\t{@render children?.()}\n</div>\n",
